<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30283" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Myrtĭlus</span></b> , i, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A son of Mercury, slain by Pelops</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. N. D.
				3, 38, 90</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen. Thyest. 140</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Claud. Laud. Ser. 168</span></i>; cf.
				<i><span class="en">Hyg.
				Fab. 84</span></i>; <i><span class="en">224</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A Roman surname</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">L. Minucius Myrtilus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					38, 42</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A historian</i>, v. Myrsilus.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
